              "shortDescription": {
                "markdown": "CVE-2023-23931: Cipher.update_into can corrupt memory if passed an immutable python object as the outbuf",
                "text": "CVE-2023-23931: Cipher.update_into can corrupt memory if passed an immutable python object as the outbuf"
